### Provenance

Correct / missing / forged / broken lineage.

### Verification

Valid / invalid / contradictory.

### Permissions

Allowed / denied / revoked / escalated.

### Independent consumption

No originating context.

### Continuity

Successor survives new session.

### Security

Tampering / replay / impersonation / injection.

### CIS

Promotion / correction / synthesis / deduplication.

### CCT

Parent / child / branching / merging.

### Network

Two-node / multi-node / disconnected / retry.

